C/ Isolated from 176-P.hal's own nested-named-substructure shape
C/ (`STATE2.STATE.ACCEL`/`.VELOCITY`/`.POSITION`, each a *named*
C/ sub-template field rather than a level-number sub-structure) --
C/ see run_all.sh's own comment on this fixture for what it locks in
C/ (yahalmat2_extn_multifile_template is only partially resolved; the
C/ deeper external-FUNCTION-returning-a-whole-STRUCTURE gap 176-P.hal
C/ itself also needs is still open).

  T:
  PROGRAM;
     STRUCTURE SUPER_VECTOR:
        1 V VECTOR,
        1 STATUS BOOLEAN,
        1 TIMETAG SCALAR;
     STRUCTURE STATEVEC:
        1 POSITION SUPER_VECTOR-STRUCTURE,
        1 VELOCITY SUPER_VECTOR-STRUCTURE;
     DECLARE ST STATEVEC-STRUCTURE;
     ST.POSITION.V = VECTOR(1, 2, 3);
     ST.VELOCITY.V = VECTOR(4, 5, 6);
     WRITE(6) 'POS=', ST.POSITION.V;
     WRITE(6) 'VEL=', ST.VELOCITY.V;
Y %SVCI(0);
  CLOSE T;
